{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55228","headline":"送小白上人归华顶（一作云守恭作） · 秀登","name":"送小白上人归华顶（一作云守恭作）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瀑溅安禅石，秋云锁碧层。\n一峰如卓笔，几日策孤藤。\n树偃前朝盖，星辉下界灯。\n超然归此处，心已契南能。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秀登","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55228.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55228","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}